  message: "Fixed in PR #2198. Re-ran the filed fixture: A.f's helper() and emit Transfer now bind A's own members (base bound B's). A call or emit resolves in its own contract, then its C3-linearised bases, then a file-level name; there is no suffix match across contracts. openzeppelin-contracts (397 .sol): 0 of 4,781 declared ids gone; calls 27,876 -> 28,079; 28 retargeted, 384 unresolved -> resolved, 203 new (182 on super.), 9 resolved -> unresolved (array push and call-result receivers); dead-code candidates 1,102 -> 1,021. NOT traced: seed_count 525 -> 524 (the library_export entrypoint for contract BridgeERC721 is absent after the fix). Residuals filed: modifier and base-constructor invocations, revert CustomError, new C(...), overload selection, import aliases."  # d8f6
